-- Schematic.cm -- the Dorado displays its own processor board drawing.Echo Fetching ProcH BIT SLICE 07, the Dorado's own schematic...Bringover [Cedar]<CedarChest6.1>Top>AISImagesEcho Painting. This sheet is 500 by 644 and takes about 20 emulatedEcho seconds of halftone work. The machine is drawing itself.Eval AISViewer.DisplayAIS[AISViewer.CreateAISViewer[], "ProcH-BitSlice07.ais", NIL, FALSE, NIL, NIL, NIL, TRUE]Eval ViewerOps.OpenIcon[ViewerOps.FindViewer["AIS Viewer"], FALSE, TRUE, TRUE]